{c: Verse 1}
[Dm] ..Kurbaan hu [Gm]aa,        Teri [Gm]tishnagi mer [Dm]yoon
Kurbaan hu [Gm]aa,        Teri [Gm]aashiui me [Gm]Yoon u [Am]u [Bb]u [A]
[Dm]Bekhudi me [C]bekhali me,        [Bb]bekashi me Hu [A]aa
Tujhko [Dm]har dua di [C]aur daga bhi,        [Bb]aur fanaa [A]hua
Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A],        Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A]
A [Dm]da pe wa [Gm]fa pe ja [C]fa pe [A],        Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A]
[Dm]Rubaru tu ma [C]gar tanha hai [F]yeh jahan
[Dm]Jal uthe meri gufr [C]se sanso ka [F]ye sama
[Dm]Kya hua [C]pal me jaane [Bb]kho gaya [A]kyu,        [Dm]Tu mila [C]aur judai [Bb]bahauma [A]yu
[Dm]Bekhudi me [C]bekhali me,        [Bb]bekashi me Hu [A]aa
Tujhko [Dm]har dua di [C]aur daga bhi,        [Bb]aur fanaa [A]hua
Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A],        Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A]
A [Dm]da pe wa [Gm]fa pe ja [C]fa pe [A],        Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A]
Mar [Dm]ne ka sabab mangata raha darbadar,        Mit [C]ne ko dil pal me raa [Dm]zi hua
Pu [Dm]ri hui har aarzu har [Dm]dastan meri,        Yeh [C]tum shuru huye jahan
[C]main kha [Gm]tam hu [A]aa,        Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A]
Kurbaan hu [Dm]aa... [C] .... [Bb] .... [A],        A [Dm]da pe wa [Gm]fa pe ja [C]fa pe [A]
